{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_1d447a6b36934b63b8140cfb78fe8578","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5cfc8b62737a080777c415e2ce4c8ac56d5df9a219ab4f2a4719a84d5f70cbce","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"getkimchi/kimchi@15cdadae0c44 snapshot 2a86d2323cfc7801","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c1be5d0c6f75715ffa4d2617f782082baec4a8cc9efa44e0d6013b81f16e4f7","slc_9d6862b972bba3ee969306f81baa494c9c3731e6152a239351be11a3406c431e","slc_d0cee0b06e3206c9fba05cf0a7a450b5bcb42490b6231bd74b8cc879db75419f","slc_ea0141b8d2f274f7d3d65430f4fda8db103d1e86b84d8920eefbbfbc11449fab"],"source_ids":["src_0f6cf79ec69e5941857254efb708262f"],"text":"Model roles include orchestrator, planner, builder, reviewer, explorer, and researcher, each configurable as a single model or a pool of candidates in `~/.config/kimchi/harness/settings.json` under `modelRoles`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1d447a6b36934b63b8140cfb78fe8578"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_1d447a6b36934b63b8140cfb78fe8578","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5d6dbf63f1ea56f2ecdf42276e7366b86216ef99281e5186475168611627d22c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"getkimchi/kimchi@15cdadae0c44 snapshot 2a86d2323cfc7801","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_17127e2f4f0660b247dc81b1d66800e459c3bc9fa454098f0fd728714e736637","slc_1b7dc4926ebcd91277de5484c7e02058f64718a4508d0391c8de5c851fcdf8ec","slc_6524187ef43fdaeb8f37642419d11001b302d6d52c0a1e45026183e0f6494b42"],"source_ids":["src_0f6cf79ec69e5941857254efb708262f"],"text":"When a role pool has multiple models, the orchestrator picks the lightest-tier model that fits and escalates to heavy-tier for complex work or after a standard-tier failure; external models default to standard tier unless given `modelMetadata`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1d447a6b36934b63b8140cfb78fe8578"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_1d447a6b36934b63b8140cfb78fe8578","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_83422bfb9e7fcff91efadcd62ef7b1d512713712f95f10df7c617f54624d8871","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"getkimchi/kimchi@15cdadae0c44 snapshot 2a86d2323cfc7801","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1a01e90bd1a19d4717e2606b07065191d14bd299765b2bd7ee8749b4409c0c08","slc_230b9860e0aaa6350bd6cc872efc3a1a6393287d29828ae5be47545b29491735","slc_b3cff435c5f4b2ef3ec69ce261a88f5188f2e7d5a1cfdf9a1b6b24147bd82c68","slc_c164b785a9c7d24d9d708028d97617cd01ac5d5f233924dd77a86698c543ce69"],"source_ids":["src_0f6cf79ec69e5941857254efb708262f"],"text":"The `/teleport` command hands an in-progress session to a cloud sandbox (requires CLI v0.1.52+, unavailable on Windows), with flags for workspace reuse, git cloning, dirty trees, and a 5 GB workspace size limit; `/sync` and `/terminal` support file transfer and SSH.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_1d447a6b36934b63b8140cfb78fe8578"}
